HOW IT WORKS
- Read anything. Novels, picture books, audiobooks, comics, the newspaper, reading aloud and being read to. Every minute counts the same.
- Log your minutes on the website, or on a paper log you bring to the library desk.
- Earn prizes. An enamel pin for any bingo, a tote bag for a full card, and a raffle entry for reaching your goal.

